<font color="#999999"><font color="#000000">
<br>
<b>From:</b> Marilyn Etzel<br>
Monday 12:24 AM<br><br>Dear Friend,</font>
<P></P> 
</FONT>
<font face="Verdana" size=2>The rising fuel costs effect every segment of our society.<font color="#000033"> Each penny that gas prices are raised is passed on to you at least 10 times over!</font> Your gas prices go up, so it costs more to get to work. Your energy prices go up so it cost you more money to stay home. Trucking prices go up so the goods you buy cost more to transport and the stores have to pass most of those costs on to...YOU! It costs more to take your family vacation...and with all those fuel surcharges, can you even afford to take a trip anyway?<br>
<strong><br>
The cost of that gas you buy effects more than just your fillup! It effects your entire life!</strong></strong></font><br>
<font color="#999999">
<P></P>
</FONT>
<p align="center">
<font size="4" face="Verdana"><font face="Verdana" size=4><strong><font color="#000033">With My Easy Save Money Simply System, You Can Tame Those Rising Costs.</font></strong></font><font color="#000033"><strong><br>
</strong></font></font></p>
<p align="justify"><font face="Verdana" size=2>In order to REALLY cut your expenses you need to find a way to save money WITHOUT making it seem like a punishment. It's just like a diet, if it feels like a punishment you won't stick with it!<br>
      <br>
      I've created a system called "Save Money Simply". It's a step-by step guide to better money management. It doesn't stop there. This is not just a simple ebook. You also get access to money saving resources, tips, articles, reports and much...much...more.</font><br>
    <font color="#999999"> </p>
